      "stem": "A 45-year-old patient is evaluated for unilateral vocal fold paralysis. The cause is damage to the nerve supply of muscles controlling movement of the arytenoid cartilage. Which of the following muscles attaches to the muscular process of this cartilage and contributes to its rotation?",
