      "stem": "A 2-year-old boy is evaluated for painless enlargement of the right hemiscrotum that varies throughout the day. The physician suspects a communicating hydrocele. Which embryonic structure normally communicates with the abdominal cavity and contributes to the formation of the serous covering of the testis during testicular descent?",
