      "stem": "A 7-year-old boy is evaluated for a unilateral undescended testis. The surgeon plans an orchiopexy (surgical relocation and fixation of the testis in the scrotum) and, during dissection of the inguinal canal, identifies a structure that guides the testis toward the scrotum during embryonic development. Which structure performs this function?",
