      "stem": "A 28-year-old man is evaluated for several months of progressive coordination difficulties. He has a broad-based gait with marked side-to-side deviation. During targeted movements of the right upper limb, he develops dysmetria and an intention tremor, while coordination of the left upper limb is nearly normal. Which part of the cerebellum is most likely affected?",
