      "stem": "A 26-year-old woman undergoes laparoscopic surgery for chronic pelvic pain. The surgeon identifies a fibrous structure that arises from the lateral aspect of the uterus, travels within the broad ligament of the uterus, and passes through the inguinal canal toward the labium majus pudendi. Which structure has been identified?",
